ki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a>）。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(\\mathfrak{A})\">\\(L(\\mathfrak{A})\\)</span> (language naming the carrier, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"45c3869fde7fe37f\" href=\"?note=45c3869fde7fe37f\" title=\"17-df-diagram\">17-df-diagram</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{A}_{\\mathfrak{A}}\">\\(\\mathfrak{A}_{\\mathfrak{A}}\\)</span> (canonical named expansion, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"45c3869fde7fe37f\" href=\"?note=45c3869fde7fe37f\" title=\"17-df-diagram\">17-df-diagram</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{L(\\mathfrak{A})}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{L(\\mathfrak{A})}\\)</span> (sentences, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"1280f7fa724c1502\" href=\"?note=1280f7fa724c1502\" title=\"17-df-sentence\">17-df-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QFForm}_{L(\\mathfrak{A})}\">\\(\\mathrm{QFForm}_{L(\\mathfrak{A})}\\)</span> (quantifier-free formulas, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"e272cfe8553473c0\" href=\"?note=e272cfe8553473c0\" title=\"17-df-quantifier-free-formula\">17-df-quantifier-free-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models\">\\(\\models\\)</span> (truth of sentences, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"528afa8a8db7f8be\" href=\"?note=528afa8a8db7f8be\" title=\"17-df-sentence-truth\">17-df-sentence-truth</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{QFDiag}\">\\(\\operatorname{QFDiag}\\)</span> (operation defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{QFDiag}(\\mathfrak{A})\n=\n\\bigl\\{\n\\sigma\\in\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{L(\\mathfrak{A})}\n\\cap\n\\mathrm{QFForm}_{L(\\mathfrak{A})}:\n\\mathfrak{A}_{\\mathfrak{A}}\\models\\sigma\n\\bigr\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{QFDiag}(\\mathfrak{A})\n=\n\\bigl\\{\n\\sigma\\in\n\\mathrm{Sent}_{L(\\mathfrak{A})}\n\\cap\n\\mathrm{QFForm}_{L(\\mathfrak{A})}:\n\\mathfrak{A}_{\\mathfrak{A}}\\models\\sigma\n\\bigr\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>The constant symbols naming elements of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\mathfrak{A}|\">\\(|\\mathfrak{A}|\\)</span> are essential, so the\nintersection must be taken in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(\\mathfrak{A})\">\\(L(\\mathfrak{A})\\)</span>, not in the original language\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>.  The ordinary diagram from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"45c3869fde7fe37f\" href=\"?note=45c3869fde7fe37f\" title=\"17-df-diagram\">17-df-diagram</a> is the atomic and negated-atomic\npart of this quantifier-free diagram.</p>\n<p>原书 p.68（DjVu84）和 p.137（DjVu153）的 diagram 仅含真原子句及其否定，p.51（DjVu67）称无量词公式为 open formulas。本地 QFDiag 将该原子图扩展为所有真布尔组合；它与普通图有相同模型，但不与普通图作为句子集合相等。精确名称未在原书 OCR 中定位到。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"fdac06af5a7f3bb5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"dab75c9f48db057d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-first-order-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"1280f7fa724c1502","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-sentence]]","em